OL,3,GNEWSAFoo Fighters confirm date for
OL,4,ADarlington debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band, supported by St Vincent and
OL,7,FYard Act, will finally sample a
OL,8,FDarlington crowd on 14 September next
OL,9,Fyear.
